& [IR5SurfaceAdapterAndLangflowDependencyDecisionV1] is the dependency-authorized adapter and Langflow decision or deferral review for IR5-IA07
  + [slice_id] is IR5-IA07
  + [slice_name] is dependency-authorized adapter and Langflow decision or deferral review
  + [model_route_used] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [decision_result] is defer_all_external_dependencies_and_adapter_implementation_for_current_IR5_proof_pass
  + [langflow_dependency_candidate] is langflow
  + [langflow_dependency_status] is deferred_to_future_explicit_surface_adapter_activation_slice
  + [irc_client_dependency_status] is deferred_to_future_transport_activation_slice
  + [matrix_client_dependency_status] is deferred_to_future_transport_activation_slice
  + [web_ui_framework_dependency_status] is deferred_to_future_UI_activation_slice
  + [package_metadata_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [dependency_installation_authorized] is false
  + [adapter_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [transport_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [UI_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [current_pure_surface_runner_status] is sufficient_for_IR5_bounded_surface_projection_proof
  + [future_langflow_status] is useful_candidate_after_visual_surface_authority_boundary_is_specified
  + [operations_control_authorized] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized] is false

  = must: preserve this decision as a deferral, not a rejection of Langflow, IRC, Matrix, web UI, or future transport adapters
  = must: require a later explicit adapter or UI activation slice before adding package dependencies, lockfiles, imports from external adapter packages, web servers, Langflow exports, IRC or Matrix clients, socket listeners, MCP clients, MCP servers, or runtime requirements
  = must: keep SOP, SJS, completion reviews, accepted decision documents, tracked fixture sources, expected ledgers, and canonical specifications as source authority
  = must: treat Langflow flows, visual graphs, API calls, MCP calls, carrier events, chat messages, UI state, and transport state as projections until rewritten into accepted SOP authority by a later reviewed process

