& [LangflowFitAssessment: IR5SurfaceProjection] is the future visual surface fit assessment for Langflow
  + [official_capability] is open source Python framework for building AI applications with a visual editor and components
  + [official_capability] is flows can be built and tested through a visual editor
  + [official_capability] is MCP client integration can connect Langflow agents to external MCP servers
  + [fit_status] is strong_future_visual_projection_surface_candidate
  + [fit_reason] is Langflow can represent workflows visually and may become a projection surface for humans to inspect agent collaboration flows
  + [mismatch_status] is authority_boundary_mismatch_if_used_directly_as_truth
  + [mismatch_reason] is Langflow flow state, component state, API calls, MCP calls, and visual graph layouts are carrier or execution projections rather than signed SOP authority
  + [adapter_need] is map LangSOP source authority records into visual projection inputs and map Langflow interactions back into request, interrupt, or completion-review records before any authority mutation

  = must: use Langflow only as a projection or adapter surface after a later boundary specifies source-to-surface and surface-to-SOP-review mappings
  = must: prevent Langflow graph success, visual node state, API response, MCP tool output, or user click from satisfying readiness, completion review, source specification processing, or next-slice gates by itself

