  = must: require generated adapter outputs to remain ignored, disposable, and reproducible unless accepted by a later review
  = must: require adapter tests to prove carrier state cannot open gates or mutate source authority
  = must: require adapter tests to prove user or agent interactions route back to request records, SOP-first interrupts, or completion review rather than direct mutation

